# ─── Supabase (database + auth + realtime) ───────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Open SQL Editor → paste supabase/migrations/0001_schema.sql → Run
# 3. Paste supabase/seed.sql → Run
# 4. Run:  npm run seed:auth   (creates the login accounts from your Excel users)
# 5. Project Settings → API: copy the Project URL + anon public key below.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# ─── Only needed for the auth seed script (keep SECRET, never ship to the client) ───
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
